{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-37011","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-57948","text":"Forge Semantic IR v1 — MEASURE (pre-freeze memo)"}]},{"id":"blk-37012","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-57949","text":"*Status: "},{"id":"spn-57950","marks":["bold"],"text":"MEASURE only — NOT frozen."},{"id":"spn-57951","text":" This is the \"measure before building\" artifact for WRL Phase 2 (freeze Forge Semantic IR v1). It inventories the IR vocabulary the forge lowering has ALREADY grounded, maps the frozen WRL Core 0.1 families onto it, and isolates the open freeze-decisions that need a GPT-5.6 ruling before anything is frozen.*"}]},{"id":"blk-37013","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-57952","text":"Per the WRL architectural rule: WRL Core → "},{"id":"spn-57953","marks":["bold"],"text":"Forge Semantic IR"},{"id":"spn-57954","text":" → TRVM facts/films/reductions. WRL surface text never lowers directly to interaction-calculus text. IR v1 is that middle layer. This memo measures what it must contain."}]},{"id":"blk-37014","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-57955","text":"1. What is already grounded (the de-facto IR)"}]},{"id":"blk-37015","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-57956","text":"The forge lowering ("},{"id":"spn-57957","marks":["code"],"text":"fixture.py"},{"id":"spn-57958","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-57959","marks":["code"],"text":"compiler.py"},{"id":"spn-57960","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-57961","marks":["code"],"text":"lower_e2a.py"},{"id":"spn-57962","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-57963","marks":["code"],"text":"admit_ic.py"},{"id":"spn-57964","text":" → IC) already consumes a structured graph description and a per-epoch input. That structure IS a proto-IR. Measured surface:"}]},{"id":"blk-37016","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-57965","text":"1.1 Node kinds (5, closed today)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-37018","spans":[{"id":"spn-57966","text":"Kind"}]},{"id":"blk-37019","spans":[{"id":"spn-57967","text":"Params"}]},{"id":"blk-37020","spans":[{"id":"spn-57968","text":"Grounded in"}]}],"id":"blk-37017","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-37021","spans":[{"id":"spn-57969","marks":["code"],"text":"pulser"}]},{"id":"blk-37022","spans":[{"id":"spn-57970","text":"clock mode: "},{"id":"spn-57971","marks":["code"],"text":"(\"periodic\", period, phase)"},{"id":"spn-57972","text":" \\"}]},{"id":"blk-37023","spans":[{"id":"spn-57973","marks":["code"],"text":"(\"once\", epoch)"}]},{"id":"blk-37024","spans":[{"id":"spn-57974","text":"fixture.py; native \"once\" since proc-e2.3"}]}],[{"id":"blk-37025","spans":[{"id":"spn-57975","marks":["code"],"text":"relay"}]},{"id":"blk-37026","spans":[{"id":"spn-57976","text":"— (sig_out; or-merge sig_in)"}]},{"id":"blk-37027","spans":[{"id":"spn-57977","text":"e2_model / lower_e2a"}]}],[{"id":"blk-37028","spans":[{"id":"spn-57978","marks":["code"],"text":"door"}]},{"id":"blk-37029","spans":[{"id":"spn-57979","text":"— (gate; sig_in)"}]},{"id":"blk-37030","spans":[{"id":"spn-57980","text":"lower_e2a"}]}],[{"id":"blk-37031","spans":[{"id":"spn-57981","marks":["code"],"text":"spinner"}]},{"id":"blk-37032","spans":[{"id":"spn-57982","text":"lane geom "},{"id":"spn-57983","marks":["code"],"text":"(w, n)"},{"id":"spn-57984","text":", init "},{"id":"spn-57985","marks":["code"],"text":"rotor4"},{"id":"spn-57986","text":", "},{"id":"spn-57987","marks":["code"],"text":"configurable"},{"id":"spn-57988","text":" permission"}]},{"id":"blk-37033","spans":[{"id":"spn-57989","text":"3b.5a/3b.5d-2"}]}],[{"id":"blk-37034","spans":[{"id":"spn-57990","marks":["code"],"text":"orb"}]},{"id":"blk-37035","spans":[{"id":"spn-57991","text":"— (holds pose4 + sticky numeric-fault bit)"}]},{"id":"blk-37036","spans":[{"id":"spn-57992","text":"3b.5c/3b.5d-2"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-37037","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-57993","text":"1.2 Ports + edge kinds (2 edge kinds, closed today)"}]},{"id":"blk-37038","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37040","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-57994","marks":["code"],"text":"OUT_PORTS = {pulser: sig_out, relay: sig_out, spinner: socket}"}]}],"id":"blk-37039","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37042","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-57995","text":"Receiving ports: "},{"id":"spn-57996","marks":["code"],"text":"sig_in"},{"id":"spn-57997","text":" (door/relay/spinner), "},{"id":"spn-57998","marks":["code"],"text":"pose"},{"id":"spn-57999","text":" (orb)."}]}],"id":"blk-37041","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37044","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58000","marks":["code"],"text":"LEGAL_PAIRS = {(sig_out, sig_in), (socket, pose)}"},{"id":"spn-58001","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-58002","marks":["bold"],"text":"two edge kinds"},{"id":"spn-58003","text":": "},{"id":"spn-58004","marks":["bold"],"text":"sig-wire"},{"id":"spn-58005","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-58006","marks":["bold"],"text":"socket"},{"id":"spn-58007","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-37043","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37046","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58008","text":"Constraints frozen in fixture schema: spinner needs exactly one sig-in + one socket; orb controller exclusivity (≤1 socket)."}]}],"id":"blk-37045","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-37047","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-58009","text":"1.3 State schema (per-node field shapes)"}]},{"id":"blk-37048","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37050","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58010","text":"counters: one-hot Scott enum (period ≤ 32) or binary ripple counter — same semantics (Binding Law 5)."}]}],"id":"blk-37049","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37052","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58011","text":"wire: "},{"id":"spn-58012","marks":["code"],"text":"cur"},{"id":"spn-58013","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-58014","marks":["code"],"text":"nxt"},{"id":"spn-58015","text":"; door: "},{"id":"spn-58016","marks":["code"],"text":"open"},{"id":"spn-58017","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-58018","marks":["code"],"text":"next_open"},{"id":"spn-58019","text":"; relay: "},{"id":"spn-58020","marks":["code"],"text":"cur_out"},{"id":"spn-58021","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-58022","marks":["code"],"text":"next_out"},{"id":"spn-58023","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-37051","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37054","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58024","text":"spinner: "},{"id":"spn-58025","marks":["code"],"text":"rotor"},{"id":"spn-58026","text":" as "},{"id":"spn-58027","marks":["bold"],"text":"runtime STATE"},{"id":"spn-58028","text":" (Q32.32 lanes), permission fixed\\|configurable."}]}],"id":"blk-37053","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37056","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58029","text":"orb: "},{"id":"spn-58030","marks":["code"],"text":"pose4"},{"id":"spn-58031","text":" + authoritative "},{"id":"spn-58032","marks":["bold"],"text":"sticky"},{"id":"spn-58033","text":" "},{"id":"spn-58034","marks":["code"],"text":"numeric_fault"},{"id":"spn-58035","text":" bit."}]}],"id":"blk-37055","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-37057","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-58036","text":"1.4 Epoch input (ADMIT layer)"}]},{"id":"blk-37058","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37060","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58037","text":"Input = batch of typed "},{"id":"spn-58038","marks":["bold"],"text":"prehashed claim envelopes"},{"id":"spn-58039","text":" "},{"id":"spn-58040","marks":["code"],"text":"SetRotor(spinner, rotor4)"},{"id":"spn-58041","text":" \\| "},{"id":"spn-58042","marks":["code"],"text":"ResetFault(orb)"},{"id":"spn-58043","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-37059","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37062","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58044","text":"Reducer output = "},{"id":"spn-58045","marks":["bold"],"text":"EpochControl"},{"id":"spn-58046","text":" = "},{"id":"spn-58047","marks":["code"],"text":"TUP(rotor_bundle, fault_bundle)"},{"id":"spn-58048","text":" = per-spinner "},{"id":"spn-58049","marks":["code"],"text":"NoChange|SetRotor(rotor4)"},{"id":"spn-58050","text":" + per-orb "},{"id":"spn-58051","marks":["code"],"text":"KeepFault|ResetFault"},{"id":"spn-58052","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-37061","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37064","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58053","text":"Claim state = bounded sorted "},{"id":"spn-58054","marks":["bold"],"text":"fact vector"},{"id":"spn-58055","text":" + separate immutable "},{"id":"spn-58056","marks":["bold"],"text":"receipt vector"},{"id":"spn-58057","text":" (Option A occupied-prefix sorted); CandidateKey identity."}]}],"id":"blk-37063","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-37065","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-58058","text":"1.5 Transition law + observability"}]},{"id":"blk-37066","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37068","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58059","text":"Per epoch "},{"id":"spn-58060","marks":["code"],"text":"t"},{"id":"spn-58061","text":": "},{"id":"spn-58062","marks":["bold"],"text":"ADMIT → COMMIT (rotor writes + fault resets) → REACT (token cascade) → latch overflow → FILM"},{"id":"spn-58063","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-37067","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37070","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58064","text":"Identity: content-addressed rulepack hash; oid↔role binding; CandidateKey for claims."}]}],"id":"blk-37069","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37072","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58065","text":"Film: "},{"id":"spn-58066","marks":["bold"],"text":"v0.6"},{"id":"spn-58067","text":" (physical: rotor-as-state, spinner permission, orb sticky fault) / "},{"id":"spn-58068","marks":["bold"],"text":"v0.7"},{"id":"spn-58069","text":" (claim-aware: policy id + facts + receipts/outcomes + recognition + capacity faults)."}]}],"id":"blk-37071","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-37073","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-58070","text":"2. WRL Core 0.1 family → IR vocabulary map"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-37075","spans":[{"id":"spn-58071","text":"WRL Core family"}]},{"id":"blk-37076","spans":[{"id":"spn-58072","text":"Forge IR grounding"}]},{"id":"blk-37077","spans":[{"id":"spn-58073","text":"Coverage"}]}],"id":"blk-37074","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-37078","spans":[{"id":"spn-58074","text":"Actor "},{"id":"spn-58075","marks":["code"],"text":"[x]"},{"id":"spn-58076","text":" (identity)"}]},{"id":"blk-37079","spans":[{"id":"spn-58077","text":"5 node kinds (pulser/relay/door/spinner/orb)"}]},{"id":"blk-37080","spans":[{"id":"spn-58078","text":"GROUNDED (concrete)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-37081","spans":[{"id":"spn-58079","text":"State "},{"id":"spn-58080","marks":["code"],"text":"(x)"}]},{"id":"blk-37082","spans":[{"id":"spn-58081","text":"§1.3 state schema"}]},{"id":"blk-37083","spans":[{"id":"spn-58082","text":"GROUNDED"}]}],[{"id":"blk-37084","spans":[{"id":"spn-58083","text":"Wiring "},{"id":"spn-58084","marks":["code"],"text":"{x}"}]},{"id":"blk-37085","spans":[{"id":"spn-58085","text":"edges (sig/socket) + ports + permission"}]},{"id":"blk-37086","spans":[{"id":"spn-58086","text":"GROUNDED"}]}],[{"id":"blk-37087","spans":[{"id":"spn-58087","text":"Route: solid "},{"id":"spn-58088","marks":["code"],"text":"--"}]},{"id":"blk-37088","spans":[{"id":"spn-58089","text":"sig-wire deterministic delivery"}]},{"id":"blk-37089","spans":[{"id":"spn-58090","text":"GROUNDED"}]}],[{"id":"blk-37090","spans":[{"id":"spn-58091","text":"Route: verified "},{"id":"spn-58092","marks":["code"],"text":"=="}]},{"id":"blk-37091","spans":[{"id":"spn-58093","text":"ADMIT accepted receipt / COMMIT"}]},{"id":"blk-37092","spans":[{"id":"spn-58094","text":"GROUNDED"}]}],[{"id":"blk-37093","spans":[{"id":"spn-58095","text":"Route: fault "},{"id":"spn-58096","marks":["code"],"text":"!!"}]},{"id":"blk-37094","spans":[{"id":"spn-58097","text":"numeric_fault latch"}]},{"id":"blk-37095","spans":[{"id":"spn-58098","text":"GROUNDED"}]}],[{"id":"blk-37096","spans":[{"id":"spn-58099","text":"Route: async "},{"id":"spn-58100","marks":["code"],"text":"~~"}]},{"id":"blk-37097","spans":[{"id":"spn-58101","text":"mailbox append"}]},{"id":"blk-37098","spans":[{"id":"spn-58102","marks":["bold"],"text":"NOT grounded"},{"id":"spn-58103","text":" (no mailbox node yet; ADMIT batch is the only async-ish input)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-37099","spans":[{"id":"spn-58104","text":"Period"}]},{"id":"blk-37100","spans":[{"id":"spn-58105","text":"epoch "},{"id":"spn-58106","marks":["code"],"text":"t"},{"id":"spn-58107","text":" + COMMIT/REACT phases"}]},{"id":"blk-37101","spans":[{"id":"spn-58108","text":"GROUNDED"}]}],[{"id":"blk-37102","spans":[{"id":"spn-58109","text":"Film"}]},{"id":"blk-37103","spans":[{"id":"spn-58110","text":"film_bytes_v6/v7"}]},{"id":"blk-37104","spans":[{"id":"spn-58111","text":"GROUNDED"}]}],[{"id":"blk-37105","spans":[{"id":"spn-58112","text":"Hash / content-id"}]},{"id":"blk-37106","spans":[{"id":"spn-58113","text":"rulepack hash + CandidateKey"}]},{"id":"blk-37107","spans":[{"id":"spn-58114","text":"GROUNDED"}]}],[{"id":"blk-37108","spans":[{"id":"spn-58115","text":"Fact-merge union"}]},{"id":"blk-37109","spans":[{"id":"spn-58116","text":"claim-fact SET UNION"}]},{"id":"blk-37110","spans":[{"id":"spn-58117","text":"GROUNDED"}]}],[{"id":"blk-37111","spans":[{"id":"spn-58118","text":"Boundary gate/commit/seal"}]},{"id":"blk-37112","spans":[{"id":"spn-58119","text":"COMMIT (rotor writes) + acceptance receipt + ADMIT gate"}]},{"id":"blk-37113","spans":[{"id":"spn-58120","text":"PARTIAL (commit grounded; explicit "},{"id":"spn-58121","marks":["code"],"text":"/gate"},{"id":"spn-58122","text":" capability node + "},{"id":"spn-58123","marks":["code"],"text":"///seal"},{"id":"spn-58124","text":" artifact registry not yet a node kind)"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-37114","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58125","marks":["bold"],"text":"Reading:"},{"id":"spn-58126","text":" 10 of 12 Core families are grounded by the concrete forge vocabulary. Two are not: "},{"id":"spn-58127","marks":["bold"],"text":"async route/mailbox"},{"id":"spn-58128","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-58129","marks":["bold"],"text":"explicit capability-gate / seal boundary nodes"},{"id":"spn-58130","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-37115","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-58131","text":"3. Open freeze-decisions (need a GPT-5.6 ruling)"}]},{"id":"blk-37116","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58132","text":"These are the genuinely undecidable-without-authority questions. Each has a recommended option, but freezing is high-commitment and prior IR/spec freezes all went through GPT-5.6."}]},{"id":"blk-37117","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58133","marks":["bold"],"text":"D1 — Abstraction level of the node vocabulary."},{"id":"spn-58134","text":" WRL Core says "},{"id":"spn-58135","marks":["italic"],"text":"Actor"},{"id":"spn-58136","text":" is ONE kind; forge has FIVE concrete kinds. Is IR v1 frozen at the "},{"id":"spn-58137","marks":["bold"],"text":"concrete"},{"id":"spn-58138","text":" layer (pulser/relay/door/spinner/orb as IR primitives) or the "},{"id":"spn-58139","marks":["bold"],"text":"abstract"},{"id":"spn-58140","text":" layer (one "},{"id":"spn-58141","marks":["code"],"text":"Actor"},{"id":"spn-58142","text":" primitive parameterized by a behavior/state schema, with the 5 as library prefabs)? "},{"id":"spn-58143","marks":["italic"],"text":"Recommendation: freeze CONCRETE (the 5 grounded kinds are what actually lower + film; an abstract actor is Experimental until a second instantiation exists)."}]},{"id":"blk-37118","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58144","marks":["bold"],"text":"D2 — Edge vocabulary closure."},{"id":"spn-58145","text":" Freeze "},{"id":"spn-58146","marks":["bold"],"text":"2"},{"id":"spn-58147","text":" grounded edge kinds (sig-wire, socket) or reserve all "},{"id":"spn-58148","marks":["bold"],"text":"4"},{"id":"spn-58149","text":" WRL route textures (adding async "},{"id":"spn-58150","marks":["code"],"text":"~~"},{"id":"spn-58151","text":" + fault "},{"id":"spn-58152","marks":["code"],"text":"!!"},{"id":"spn-58153","text":" as declared-but-unlowered)? "},{"id":"spn-58154","marks":["italic"],"text":"Recommendation: freeze 2 as IR-normative; RESERVE async/fault names as declared-only (no lowering), mirroring how WRL.md reserves undefined forms."}]},{"id":"blk-37119","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58155","marks":["bold"],"text":"D3 — Is ADMIT graph structure or epoch input?"},{"id":"spn-58156","text":" Currently claims/receipts/EpochControl are a per-epoch INPUT, not graph topology. Does IR v1 (a) keep ADMIT as a separate \"epoch-input IR\" beside the graph IR, or (b) fold claim/receipt vectors into node state? "},{"id":"spn-58157","marks":["italic"],"text":"Recommendation: (a) — keep the graph IR (durable topology + state schema) separate from the epoch-input IR (batch → EpochControl). They have different lifetimes; conflating them re-introduces the merge problem the ruling warned about."}]},{"id":"blk-37120","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58158","marks":["bold"],"text":"D4 — State schema: part of IR v1 or a sidecar?"},{"id":"spn-58159","text":" Per-node field shapes (Q32.32 rotor, sticky fault, one-hot/binary counter) — frozen INSIDE IR v1 as each node kind's typed state signature, or a separate versioned \"state schema\" so representation (Law 5) can evolve without rev'ing the IR? "},{"id":"spn-58160","marks":["italic"],"text":"Recommendation: freeze the state SIGNATURE (field names + semantic types) in IR v1; leave REPRESENTATION (one-hot vs binary, lane width) to a sidecar (Law 5: representation ≠ meaning)."}]},{"id":"blk-37121","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58161","marks":["bold"],"text":"D5 — Scope: freeze now, or after a second grounded instantiation?"},{"id":"spn-58162","text":" IR v1 would freeze on a SINGLE grounded instantiation (the E2a circuit + SetRotor/ResetFault ADMIT). Freeze v1 now on that basis, or hold until a second, structurally different graph is lowered (to avoid baking in E2a-specific shape)? *Recommendation: this is the crux for GPT-5.6. Freezing on one instantiation risks over-fitting; waiting delays the sanctioned lowering target. Prior discipline (\"measure before building\", finite-before-open-ended) leans toward: freeze a "},{"id":"spn-58163","marks":["bold"],"text":"minimal v1 core"},{"id":"spn-58164","text":" (D1 concrete + D2 two-edge + D3 separate + D4 signature) explicitly SCOPED to the grounded surface, versioned so a second instantiation drives v1.1 — rather than a speculative general IR.*"}]},{"id":"blk-37122","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-58165","text":"4. Recommendation summary (for ruling)"}]},{"id":"blk-37123","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58166","text":"Freeze "},{"id":"spn-58167","marks":["bold"],"text":"Forge Semantic IR v1"},{"id":"spn-58168","text":" as a MINIMAL, grounded-only core:"}]},{"id":"blk-37124","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37126","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58169","text":"5 concrete node kinds (D1), 2 edge kinds + 2 reserved route names (D2),"}]}],"id":"blk-37125","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37128","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58170","text":"graph IR separate from epoch-input IR (D3),"}]}],"id":"blk-37127","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37130","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58171","text":"typed state signatures with representation as a sidecar (D4),"}]}],"id":"blk-37129","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37132","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58172","text":"explicitly scoped to the single grounded instantiation, versioned for a second (D5)."}]}],"id":"blk-37131","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-37133","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58173","marks":["bold"],"text":"Halting for GPT-5.6 on D1–D5 before writing the frozen `FORGE_SEMANTIC_IR_v1.md`."},{"id":"spn-58174","text":" No freeze is committed until these are ruled."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaiera3jogu2s74yjlidnia5752dyzocljoq2lrkqexge3qy45ldlh4nna","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}